  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "jane.irwin@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>ALLENDALE, N.J.--(<a href=\"http://www.businesswire.com/\" target=\"_blank\">BUSINESS WIRE</a>)--<a href=\"http://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ascentialhealth.com%2F&amp;esheet=51445649&amp;newsitemid=20161025005388&amp;lan=en-US&amp;anchor=Ascential&amp;index=1&amp;md5=11da0178642c3e00ed4c7d8c0d8ea0e8\" target=\"_blank\">Ascential</a>,&nbsp;an innovative implant and delivery solution for lower acuity spinal procedures in the ambulatory surgery center (ASC) and hospital settings, will be introduced at the North American Spine Society (NASS) Annual Meeting in Boston, Oct. 26-29, 2016 (booth No. 1511).</p>\n<p>Ascential offers a portfolio of newly designed sterile-packaged implants, customized service levels, and a streamlined distribution model. The innovative Ascential solution is intended to provide operational efficiencies, competitive pricing, and reduced operating costs so that staff can spend less time managing logistics and more time and resources on patient care.</p>\n<p><b>Read the full article:</b></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20161025005388/en/Innovative-Product-Service-Offering-Future-Spinal-Surgery\" target=\"_blank\">Business Wire</a></p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jun 02 2017 10:57:27 GMT-0400",
